# Credentials Vault — AES-256-GCM key for stored passwords (32 random bytes, base64).
# Generate one with:
#   node -e "console.log(require('crypto').randomBytes(32).toString('base64'))"
# Without it (or with a malformed value) the server still starts, logs a warning,
# and every /api/vault route answers 503. Never change it once passwords are
# stored: values encrypted under the old key can no longer be decrypted.
VAULT_ENC_KEY=
